0x559c7fdbb5ec is located 20 bytes before global variable 'encode_ise(quant_method, unsigned int, unsigned char const*, unsigned char*, unsigned int)::tbits' defined in '/src/astc-encoder/Source/./astcenc_integer_sequence.cpp:628' (0x559c7fdbb600) of size 2
